# Neustack E-Commerce Application

`docker compose up --build` to start the database and application containers, data will be seeded using init.sql

`docker compose down -v` to stop the containers.

`python3 test_api.py` runs API tests when the containers are up. This must be run before any APIs are called else it may fail because of changes in database.

`spring-boot-collection.postman_collection.json` - import into postman to use the API's when the containers are running.
